+        If shutdown_linger is not None, also stop that many seconds after
+        buf_1 goes inactive, whether or not buf_2 has. Only pass it where
+        buf_1 inactive means the local side has closed and nothing more
+        of value can arrive - the DoubleTLSClient forwarding child. The
+        bridge's inner-stream forwarding must not use it: there buf_1
+        inactive merely means the client finished its half of the inner
+        session, and the server's half is still legitimately in flight.
+
         '''
         # The poll loop is simply two unidirectional forwarding poll loops
         # combined into one.
+        linger_deadline = None
         while buf_1._active or buf_2._active:
